    "source": {
      "value": "lome"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Description:\nYour natural form's fangs are capable of injecting foes with venom. You gain the Anadi Venom ability.\n\n**Anadi Venom [1 action]**\nYou envenom your fangs. If the next fangs Strike you make before the end of your turn hits and deals damage, the Strike deals an additional 1d6 poison damage. On a critical failure, the poison is wasted as normal. At 12th level, this poison damage increases to 2d6."
    },
